{"script":"s_1_18_1","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"charaName":"侍者维丝","text":"[show]嗯？“当上侍者的女孩子一般喜欢什么礼物”……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"侍者维丝","text":"[show]说实话……我一时间还真想不出来。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"侍者维丝","text":"[show]以我为参照？但我好像也没有什么特别喜欢的礼物啊。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"侍者维丝","text":"[show]有了，我记得我小时候，从儿时的玩伴那收到过一个布娃娃，我当时特别开心。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"侍者维丝","text":"[show]我想……女孩子一般都会喜欢这种东西吧……[l][cm][hide]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"","text":"[hide]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"（询问礼物的事。）"}